1
00:00:00,553 --> 00:00:02,353
(Sheldon:)May I say something?

2
00:00:02,355 --> 00:00:03,685
(Leonard:)Not right
now, Sheldon.

3
00:00:03,689 --> 00:00:05,019
(Sheldon:)But I think it would
be comforting.

4
00:00:05,024 --> 00:00:06,954
(Leonard:)Buddy...
No, it's okay.

5
00:00:06,959 --> 00:00:08,929
(Penny:)What?

6
00:00:09,896 --> 00:00:12,566
(Sheldon:)When I lost my own father,

7
00:00:12,565 --> 00:00:14,835
(Sheldon:)I didn't have any friends
to help me through it.

8
00:00:16,035 --> 00:00:17,735
(Bernadette:)You do.

9
00:00:23,242 --> 00:00:26,382
(choked up): I really thought
he was gonna say, "Let it go."

10
00:00:35,154 --> 00:00:36,754
(Raj(on phone):)Okay, thanks, Bernadette.

11
00:00:36,756 --> 00:00:38,426
(Raj(on phone):)Travel safe.

12
00:00:38,424 --> 00:00:41,094
(Raj(on phone):)Okay, bye.

13
00:00:41,094 --> 00:00:42,424
(sighs)

14
00:00:42,428 --> 00:00:43,598
They booked a flight.

15
00:00:43,596 --> 00:00:44,826
(Raj(on phone):)They're heading
to the airport now.

16
00:00:44,831 --> 00:00:46,631
(Penny:)How's Howard holding up?

17
00:00:46,632 --> 00:00:47,962
(Raj:)He's hanging in there.

18
00:00:47,967 --> 00:00:49,667
(Leonard:)How are you doing, Stuart?

19
00:00:51,637 --> 00:00:52,967
(Stuart:)Still can't believe she's gone.

20
00:00:52,972 --> 00:00:55,942
(Stuart:)I mean, that woman took me in.

21
00:00:55,942 --> 00:00:58,672
(Stuart:)If it wasn't for her,
I-I would have been homeless.

22
00:00:58,678 --> 00:01:00,678
(Amy:)One of us would
have taken you in.

